<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka two-year bonds heavily oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka two-year bonds heavily oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's Central Bank said on Wednesday its latest auction of two-year treasury bonds to raise 500 million rupees was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>	  Amount offered:	500 million rupees</p>
<p>	  Bids received:	 1,335 million rupees</p>
<p>	  Amount accepted:     500 million rupees</p>
<p>	  Weighted avg yield:  12.96 percent per year (current)</p>
<p>				     13.44 percent (previous)</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
